\":2,\"38\":2,\"39\":1,\"40\":3,\"41\":3,\"42\":3,\"43\":3,\"44\":3,\"45\":3,\"46\":3,\"47\":3,\"48\":3,\"49\":3,\"50\":3,\"51\":3,\"52\":3,\"53\":3,\"54\":3,\"55\":3,\"56\":3,\"57\":3,\"58\":3,\"59\":3,\"60\":3,\"61\":3,\"62\":3}}},\"docs\":{\"docs\":{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Latest News\",\"content\":\"# Latest News\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"/community/news\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"locale\":\"en\"},\"2\":{\"title\":\"Community Guidelines\",\"content\":\"# Community Guidelines\\n\\n\\\\>catcommunity\\\\_rules.txt\\n\\n12 rules loaded successfully...\\n\\n#1General\\n\\n### 1\\\\. Discord guidelines\\n\\nThe Discord Community Guidelines apply to Programming \\\\[DE / EN\\\\]; users can view these at https://discord.com/guidelines.\\n\\n#2General\\n\\n### 2\\\\. Language\\n\\nThe language of our community is German and English. In the voice channel, \\\"Public \\\\[DE\\\\]\\\" German is the primary language. Users can speak English voluntarily. However, users must speak English in the Voice Channel \\\"Public \\\\[EN\\\\]\\\".\\n\\n#3General\\n\\n### 3\\\\. Asking questions\\n\\n3.1 Nobody is obliged to help or answer a question. Help is generally free of charge. 3.2 Members with the role of \\\"HELPER\\\" have volunteered to help with questions. 3.3 Pinging members to expect a faster response is not allowed. 3.4 Don't ask questions like \\\"Does anyone know about XY?\\\" ask the question directly, see also ➔ https://dontasktoask.com/. 3.5 Note the thread \\\"How do I ask a good question?\\\" on Stackoverflow ➔ https://stackoverflow.com/help/how-to-ask.\\n\\n#4Behavior\\n\\n### 4\\\\. Recording\\n\\nThe recording of videos (screen sharing, webcam) and sound (voice chat) is not permitted on this Discord.\\n\\n#5Behavior\\n\\n### 5\\\\. Advertising\\n\\nAny kind of third-party advertising is prohibited.\\n\\n#6Authority\\n\\n### 6\\\\. Moderators\\n\\nThe moderation team has the right to take appropriate actions against a user, even if a certain rule has not been explicitly violated.\\n\\n#7Behavior\\n\\n### 7\\\\. Direct messages\\n\\nPlease refrain from sending direct messages to the administrators.\\n\\n#8Behavior\\n\\n### 8\\\\. Dissemination of personal information\\n\\nDissemination of other people's personal information of any kind without their consent is prohibited and will result in a permanent ban.\\n\\n#9Authority\\n\\n### 9\\\\. Enforcement of a measure\\n\\nThe interpretation of the rules is at the discretion of the respective administrator.\\n\\n#10Content\\n\\n### 10\\\\. AI Use / Spam / Job listings\\n\\nThe use of AI to make job listings or other spam content is not permitted. Users found doing so will be jailed, muted, or banned.\\n\\n#11Content\\n\\n### 11\\\\. Fake Skills / Code Stacks\\n\\nFalsely claiming to have skills or experience for the purpose of scamming or obtaining jobs is prohibited. Users must be able to prove their skills.\\n\\n#12Content\\n\\n### 12\\\\. No DM\\n\\nNo direct messages without previous authorization. If someone reports you, you may be muted or restricted.\",\"description\":\"The Discord Community Guidelines apply to Programming [DE / EN]; users can view these at https://discord.com/guidelines.\",\"url\":\"/community/rules\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"locale\":\"en\"},\"3\":{\"title\":\"Community Showcase\",\"content\":\"# Community Showcase(0)\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"/community/showcase\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"locale\":\"en\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Our Team\",\"content\":\"# Our Team\\n\\n0\\n\\n### Don\\n\\nNitro since October 29, 2025Owner\\n\\n@0\\\\_don\\n\\nPlaying Custom Status\\n\\nK\\n\\n### Papi 👌🏻\\n\\nNitro since October 5, 2021Owner\\n\\n@knastfahrer\\n\\nP\\n\\n### Sponjibobu\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@plar0lex\\\\_\\n\\nR\\n\\n### RICHIE 💸💵🤑\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@richie007xd\\n\\nE\\n\\n### eN\\\\_Pilz\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@en\\\\_pilz\\n\\nA\\n\\n### Anes\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@anes3653\\n\\n1\\n\\n### Ceto\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@1hunddreissiger\\n\\nS\\n\\n### Sponjibobu\\n