o since October 2, 2025Booster\\n\\n@alwaysfriend.\"],[24,\"# PHP(0)\"],[55,\"# PHP(0)\"],[10,\"# Python\\n\\nPython is really only relevant for specific fields like data science, machine learning, scientific computing, and automation scripting. Outside of these areas, it's not particularly useful.\\n\\nMany people choose Python as their first language because they think it's simple. While the syntax is readable, this simplicity doesn't transfer well to other languages or real-world development. If you want to become a full-stack developer, JavaScript is a much better choice since it works on both frontend and backend.\\n\\nBut if you really want to learn Python, check out [FreeCodeCamp's Scientific Computing with Python](https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn/scientific-computing-with-python/) or [Codecademy's Python courses](https://www.codecademy.com/catalog/language/python).\"],[41,\"# Python\\n\\nPython is really only relevant for specific fields like data science, machine learning, scientific computing, and automation scripting. Outside of these areas, it's not particularly useful.\\n\\nMany people choose Python as their first language because they think it's simple. While the syntax is readable, this simplicity doesn't transfer well to other languages or real-world development. If you want to become a full-stack developer, JavaScript is a much better choice since it works on both frontend and backend.\\n\\nBut if you really want to learn Python, check out [FreeCodeCamp's Scientific Computing with Python](https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn/scientific-computing-with-python/) or [Codecademy's Python courses](https://www.codecademy.com/catalog/language/python).\"],[14,\"# Python(0)\"],[45,\"# Python(0)\"],[39,\"# Resources\\n\\nCurated learning resources, tools, and guides for developers\\n\\n## Programming Languages\\n\\nLearn popular programming languages with curated resources\\n\\n[\\n\\n### JavaScript\\n\\nWeb development essentials\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/ressou